# SonarQube - Local POC Access Token
#
# Copy to "sonarqube-token.txt" (no .example suffix). That file is
# gitignored and MUST NEVER be committed. LOCAL POC USE ONLY.
#
# Works for BOTH supported deployments:
#   - SonarQube Server / Community Build (self-managed, on-prem): generate
#     a User Token under My Account > Security.
#   - SonarQube Cloud: generate a token under My Account > Security; also
#     set the -Organization parameter on scripts that require it (Cloud
#     only - Server ignores it).
#
# Required: a SonarQube user token scoped to the minimum permission
# needed for the operations you intend to exercise.
#
# Format: the raw token value only.
REPLACE_WITH_REAL_SONARQUBE_TOKEN
